 States Atomic \nEnergy Commission, with the approval \nof the General Manager thereof or one \nof his designees, to hold office as consta­\nbles, deputy sheriffs, or other law enforce­\nment officers, and to hold state or local \noffices, under the laws of the States in \nwhich such employees may be on duty: \nProvided, That the General M","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_10045.txt","sha256":"38833dd11c0de1b415c1352d8f9e86109fbaab7124ea0734e3d959e098e05657","source":{"line":540,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"ce46cb0c918a1a055f8d219698780b3977fc11d95604d638887efda1c327773c"}}]}
